{"posts":[{"id":"mertch_p10_1","t":"staurum, some brokers let you download M1 data till 1993 or so, but for live accounts. Go to Tools, history Center and select the currency pair, select M1 and download.","a":"ViTaLDRuG","d":"27 Apr 2017 23:16","n":"#1","p":10,"im":[],"m":63192},{"id":"mertch_p10_2","t":"Sorry guys, I'm well busy fixing some rtm stuff with my bud Harry & IF. I should be back in few days. Seems that everyone here having fun and getting the BOE, BOJ and FED money, well done!","a":"mertch","d":"16 May 2017 23:38","n":"#2","p":10,"im":[],"m":63498},{"id":"mertch_p10_3","t":"Hi Mertch,\n\nI just finished reading your journal and I have to admit I didn't understand some as they were too \"naked\" for me (of course this is not to critic you). But as for the others with a little explanation. It was perfect. Not confusing, easy to read, and easy to understand. You were very generous with answering the questions.\n\nI would have to review again what I have read, but I definitely had some light bulb moments already. Thank you for your effort and hoping to see more post. :D","a":"Enlightenme","d":"16 Jun 2017 14:55","n":"#3","p":10,"im":[],"m":64007},{"id":"mertch_p10_4","t":"Hi M,\n\nI dont understand how you managed to hold this one. would you kindly please share what's the trick behind the magic here?\n\nThis is what would've happened to me","a":"staurum","d":"18 Jul 2017 10:30","n":"#4","p":10,"im":["66c5f80eb7834c2b79f8fa275a45bcaf6f7f53d3"],"m":64882},{"id":"mertch_p10_5","t":"Come to think of it, kinda miss good old M trades, please pop in....","a":"linos","d":"18 Jul 2017 15:34","n":"#5","p":10,"im":[],"m":64891},{"id":"mertch_p10_6","t":"I've already took out 1/2 but this is a nice one","a":"mertch","d":"23 Sep 2017 04:38","n":"#6","p":10,"im":["9a3d15c34669b2fb87c8d0870f888a0b9acf7817"],"m":67521},{"id":"mertch_p10_7","t":"This is for staurum,","a":"mertch","d":"23 Sep 2017 05:05","n":"#7","p":10,"im":["8fa13c4b953d9fc41c710b6cd2ede9c623d8fd5c"],"m":67522},{"id":"mertch_p10_8","t":"","a":"mertch","d":"23 Sep 2017 13:10","n":"#8","p":10,"im":["1a9ecd5532a9c1f7e2445d9c37697d66554100fe"],"m":67524},{"id":"mertch_p10_9","t":"","a":"mertch","d":"23 Sep 2017 13:28","n":"#9","p":10,"im":["fc80cb57bbd67c736e0c33fc88a263e635519593","498602970b7c23f67ffa5392a7a84176ccbcd00f"],"m":67525},{"id":"mertch_p10_10","t":"Mertch, really amazing trades.\n\nI was trying to understand the UsdChf one.\n\nI thinks I am missing something, but let's see if this can be a start","a":"franc464","d":"23 Sep 2017 15:41","n":"#10","p":10,"im":["e212dd414d03170a13857eea109e136a97c6d4de"],"m":67527},{"id":"mertch_p10_11","t":"The trade opp is very visible on the weekly","a":"Ifmyante","d":"23 Sep 2017 16:14","n":"#11","p":10,"im":[],"m":67528},{"id":"mertch_p10_12","t":"hurt my eyes so much trying to find the symmetry of price or locate the small kink in weekly haha","a":"jacktrader","d":"23 Sep 2017 17:03","n":"#12","p":10,"im":[],"m":67529},{"id":"mertch_p10_13","t":"For those who did understand my UCHF trade...","a":"mertch","d":"23 Sep 2017 21:32","n":"#13","p":10,"im":["424acad26f179fb974b84084fb0792afa9f251e3","3f55672c663135123684384f460db24a37670fe3","f20274f97f8aa04c53cd33db69f874395a409415"],"m":67535},{"id":"mertch_p10_14","t":"Thank you Mertch, you trades are a joy, so glad you came back around. I love the phrase: i look for where PA has not been respected.\n\na golden statement amongst others","a":"linos","d":"23 Sep 2017 21:50","n":"#14","p":10,"im":[],"m":67536},{"id":"mertch_p10_15","t":"Everything on trading is about the past, historical levels, lows, highs. Will they make PA, kink around old decisions levels, lows, highs. What reactions we can expect, approch on those. Interpretation is a big part of it and nothing can't replace screen time, charting and patience.","a":"mertch","d":"23 Sep 2017 23:13","n":"#15","p":10,"im":["7a7cda3021a605f62ed5cb40367edc16602c4414","3ee32a078bf7bb0b62ea0bd2be15ed650332ca84"],"m":67537},{"id":"mertch_p10_16","t":"Screentime, charting and patience turns a normal driver into a car drifter","a":"staurum","d":"24 Sep 2017 12:24","n":"#16","p":10,"im":["a9169146b03f8d0f295b7a631747b46a71767d63"],"m":67548},{"id":"mertch_p10_17","t":"mertch wrote: For those who did understand my UCHF trade...\n\nHello Mertch, this is mesmerizing! And it is the first time I read something so far-fetched:\n\n\"Price seemingly has hit a target, but no PA inside, first touch\"\n\nSo your statement implies that just by touching a target is not good enough, you need to see PA inside? Could you pls explain what kind of PA do we need to see inside a target to confirm that a target has indeed been hit?\n\nThank you very much.\n\nAK","a":"Astrokillah","d":"24 Sep 2017 17:17","n":"#17","p":10,"im":["3f55672c663135123684384f460db24a37670fe3"],"m":67556},{"id":"mertch_p10_18","t":"If you look that way, seems to me it was only s/r. I think there is more significant target hit whitch shouldn't be trade on return .","a":"mertch","d":"24 Sep 2017 21:00","n":"#18","p":10,"im":["8a015e33815f4222d43e0815804190d9b79e06e3"],"m":67561},{"id":"mertch_p10_19","t":"","a":"mertch","d":"27 Sep 2017 21:22","n":"#19","p":10,"im":["e8763234841526c7b63f721351d2380ffa20295b"],"m":67712},{"id":"mertch_p10_20","t":"DM again","a":"mertch","d":"28 Sep 2017 00:12","n":"#20","p":10,"im":["b56cd3549fbc3d3b0f7da4ac9fae45591136e126"],"m":67728},{"id":"mertch_p10_21","t":"Hi traders, I wanted to take the same trade I've took yesterday on UCAD but this time I was looking UJ. I've draw my FL as usual, then wait for price to comeback at level / FL. I've set my PO at FO, SL 1 pip below FL then wait and see. I was so sure the price would bounce inside FL but surprise, it went down 0.001 below it and bounce back higher. Great! it was time to test IF's theory on engulf. So I've wait for price to go back to next QM level, took a manual entry, price went to DM level and begun to go back down. In conclusion, even a fraction is an engulf, it will fly to the next FL at first occasion, there is nothing more to say.","a":"mertch","d":"29 Sep 2017 03:34","n":"#21","p":10,"im":["7068ba02657a39780b556baa8d76b27aeb2dfc1b","53f5da4b2e41b0c32813c3f3c25e42c2ece3b599","a084218087da8159db7fb57d885399e767496e81"],"m":67779},{"id":"mertch_p10_22","t":"Master Mertch, you're making me speechless again! your SL is a little wide here, too wide for your usual standard..\n\nmertch wrote:","a":"Astrokillah","d":"29 Sep 2017 15:26","n":"#22","p":10,"im":["a084218087da8159db7fb57d885399e767496e81"],"m":67787},{"id":"mertch_p10_23","t":"Hi Mertch,\n\nThanks for pointing that out, more things for us to study!\n\nI was wondering, is that the famous but discrete \"continuation engulf\"?","a":"HCDE","d":"29 Sep 2017 16:15","n":"#23","p":10,"im":[],"m":67789},{"id":"mertch_p10_24","t":"Actually, it seems that there are a lot of examples of what you described in charts...\n\nIt makes me think of salivan's material, i've studied that for days and never found an example, now that you pointed out one i find them everywhere.","a":"HCDE","d":"29 Sep 2017 16:46","n":"#24","p":10,"im":["925aba1df0def27aebaaf178abf795859bc6cb7c"],"m":67792},{"id":"mertch_p10_25","t":"Long on PA again","a":"mertch","d":"29 Sep 2017 22:01","n":"#25","p":10,"im":["1205bb2b51e42998340e521564f6b14fe0ba3123"],"m":67816}],"images":[{"k":"66c5f80eb7834c2b79f8fa275a45bcaf6f7f53d3","t":"assets/thumbs/66c5f80eb7834c2b79f8fa275a45bcaf6f7f53d3.webp","f":"assets/images/66c5f80eb7834c2b79f8fa275a45bcaf6f7f53d3.png","w":1500,"h":694,"b":75397,"o":"...10.24.00am.png","p":10,"pid":"mertch_p10_4"},{"k":"9a3d15c34669b2fb87c8d0870f888a0b9acf7817","t":"assets/thumbs/9a3d15c34669b2fb87c8d0870f888a0b9acf7817.webp","f":"assets/images/9a3d15c34669b2fb87c8d0870f888a0b9acf7817.png","w":1500,"h":753,"b":86479,"o":"...2017-09-22.png","p":10,"pid":"mertch_p10_6"},{"k":"8fa13c4b953d9fc41c710b6cd2ede9c623d8fd5c","t":"assets/thumbs/8fa13c4b953d9fc41c710b6cd2ede9c623d8fd5c.webp"